    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>MOVEMENT UNLIVING-GHOUL</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 4</p>\n<p>Your limbs coil and spring with the predatory tension of a carrion hunter.</p>\n<p>You gain Natural Leaper. When you take the High Jump action, you may jump a distance up to half your land Speed without making a check. When you take the Long Jump action, you may leap up to your land Speed without taking an action. You ignore the penalty for lacking a running start on these checks.</p>\n<p>Works automatically (Natural Leaper): a High Jump up to half your land Speed needs no check; a Long Jump up to your land Speed needs no check and no action; never the run-up penalty.</p>",
